WEBVTT

00:03.470 --> 00:06.150
It can't be! What's he doing here?!

00:06.610 --> 00:07.870
Sir Kyle!

00:08.450 --> 00:10.820
For what purpose have you come here?

00:11.250 --> 00:13.950
Turning your sword on me first?

00:13.950 --> 00:15.490
I hope you haven't forgotten

00:16.250 --> 00:18.200
who the real enemy is!

00:19.250 --> 00:21.530
I'm on your side now.

00:21.530 --> 00:24.870
I turned over a new leaf
after Touka cast me into the ocean.

00:26.330 --> 00:27.420
Sir Kyle!

00:27.420 --> 00:29.820
I always believed that this day would come!

00:29.820 --> 00:31.050
Don't believe squat!

00:31.050 --> 00:33.800
He literally said he's here
for revenge on Touka!

00:33.800 --> 00:36.220
Kyle Ozment...

00:36.220 --> 00:38.620
I've heard all the rumors.

00:38.620 --> 00:41.560
This might make things even more fun!

00:45.190 --> 00:47.100
Kindly don't intrude, would you?

00:47.100 --> 00:49.340
If you wish to fight me that badly,

00:49.340 --> 00:52.120
I'll have to ask you to wait 
until Touka awakens.

00:52.120 --> 00:54.710
My revenge on him takes priority.

00:55.610 --> 00:56.450
Revenge?!

00:56.450 --> 01:00.790
I'm not sure you're in any position
to enjoy a fight, however...

01:01.670 --> 01:03.330
Take a peek in town.

01:03.880 --> 01:06.260
Ein Andromalius.

01:13.230 --> 01:15.760
Reinforcements from the capital?!

01:17.310 --> 01:19.290
Have you grasped the situation?

01:19.290 --> 01:21.820
Touka's my priority right now.

01:21.820 --> 01:24.040
If you wish to flee, I'll allow it.

01:24.040 --> 01:26.690
Whyever would I run?

01:28.810 --> 01:32.150
The ultimate pleasure still lies ahead!

01:32.150 --> 01:35.720
What's got you turning on your allies now?

01:35.720 --> 01:36.530
It can't be...

01:36.930 --> 01:39.530
He's absorbing the devils?!

01:43.860 --> 01:45.270
Sir Kyle!

01:48.260 --> 01:49.710
Worry not.

01:49.710 --> 01:51.520
I fully blocked it.

01:51.520 --> 01:53.170
You kind of didn't!

01:55.490 --> 01:59.340
My victory was sealed 
the moment the devils arrived!

01:59.340 --> 02:04.150
All the mana and spells 
I absorb become mine!

02:04.150 --> 02:05.570
No way...

02:05.570 --> 02:07.740
But we have so little time left

02:08.650 --> 02:13.270
that even if Touka awakens now, I'm doomed.

02:15.820 --> 02:17.280
I just...

02:17.280 --> 02:19.770
I just want to talk to you one more time!

02:20.790 --> 02:22.210
Touka!

02:24.370 --> 02:26.420
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

02:28.060 --> 02:30.240
Dead, dead, another day dead

02:30.240 --> 02:32.170
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

02:32.170 --> 02:34.300
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

02:34.300 --> 02:37.050
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

02:36.180 --> 02:37.070
<b>THE</b>

02:37.070 --> 02:37.610
<b>LEGEN</b>

02:37.610 --> 02:38.110
<b>DARY</b>

02:38.110 --> 02:38.570
<b>HERO</b>

02:38.570 --> 02:39.070
<b>IS</b>

02:39.030 --> 02:39.530
<b>DEAD</b>

02:43.900 --> 02:45.570
Spending every day like 
you're in a casket, trapped

02:45.570 --> 02:47.640
Ready for another night 
like the dead, collapsed

02:47.640 --> 02:49.390
Yeah, living like a carcass
 with just your "life" intact...

02:49.390 --> 02:51.680
Who wouldn't want a way 
to con themselves out of that?

02:51.680 --> 02:53.770
Breaking away from ideas of "should do"

02:53.770 --> 02:55.690
to live for yourself—
that's lots of fun, too...

02:55.690 --> 02:57.620
Otherwise you're just being a mark...

02:57.620 --> 02:58.730
And who wants that?

02:58.730 --> 03:02.240
You and I, we're just corpses

03:02.240 --> 03:06.510
Pawns of some faceless necromancer

03:06.510 --> 03:10.250
From one marionette to another, I say...

03:10.250 --> 03:16.420
How about we cut our strings together?

03:16.420 --> 03:17.220
Let's get dancing!

03:17.220 --> 03:19.260
Dead, dead, another day dead

03:19.260 --> 03:21.330
Head, arms, and legs gonna 
fall off any minute now

03:21.330 --> 03:23.350
Whole body hollowed out, dry as a desert...

03:23.350 --> 03:25.180
Ha, ha, ha, ha!

03:25.180 --> 03:27.240
Dead, dead, we're already dead

03:27.240 --> 03:29.270
Gonna shake off this 
mortal coil any minute now

03:29.270 --> 03:31.230
You just gotta laugh a life like this off!

03:31.230 --> 03:33.730
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!

03:33.730 --> 03:37.570
I tell you, this world makes life so hard

03:37.570 --> 03:41.450
What can you do but dance 
the whole night through?

03:41.450 --> 03:44.710
Even if I collapse and my body decays

03:44.710 --> 03:49.490
that doesn't mean I'm rotten 
all the way down to my soul!

03:55.540 --> 03:58.920
<b>Episode 12</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:58.920
<b>The Legendary Hero Is a Duo!</b>

03:56.260 --> 03:58.920
Huh? Where the heck am I?

03:58.920 --> 04:04.340
After I used the soma drops, 
everything went black, and...

04:04.340 --> 04:05.620
No freaking way!

04:05.620 --> 04:07.640
This ain't the afterlife, is it?!

04:07.640 --> 04:08.920
No worries there.

04:08.920 --> 04:10.890
You're still alive.

04:11.370 --> 04:13.480
This is the world of the Sacred Sword.

04:14.330 --> 04:15.690
It's been quite some time.

04:16.110 --> 04:18.920
Actually, this is our first 
meeting in a way, isn't it...

04:21.070 --> 04:22.320
Touka?

04:22.930 --> 04:24.660
<i>Sion the hero?!</i>

04:24.660 --> 04:28.520
<i>If he's here, that means I'm dead for sure!</i>

04:29.120 --> 04:30.660
What the hell?

04:30.660 --> 04:33.460
You want revenge, right? 
Is that what this is about?

04:33.460 --> 04:34.690
Lemme make one thing clear.

04:34.690 --> 04:36.980
It's not my fault you're dead!

04:36.980 --> 04:38.920
You fell into that damn trap yourself!

04:39.300 --> 04:40.880
Thank you so much!

04:42.480 --> 04:44.300
I've been watching this whole time.

04:44.620 --> 04:47.520
Although you were made into 
the legendary hero against your will,

04:47.520 --> 04:49.530
you kept Anri safe from Kyle,

04:49.530 --> 04:51.240
saved the capital from danger,

04:51.240 --> 04:55.940
and now you're fighting a deadly battle 
to save the people of Moaran.

04:56.420 --> 05:00.520
I'm so glad you were the one 
to inherit my body.

05:02.360 --> 05:04.240
Oh, I'm so sorry!

05:04.240 --> 05:06.720
I'm sure being awfully forward...

05:06.720 --> 05:09.850
But I've been watching you for so long, 
I feel like we're friends.

05:09.850 --> 05:11.200
<i>That's not the issue...</i>

05:11.200 --> 05:14.410
<i>Did this dude seriously
just thank the guy who killed him?</i>

05:14.940 --> 05:17.540
<i>He's </i>definitely<i> up to something!</i>

05:17.540 --> 05:21.120
<i>Even if this is the afterlife, 
I can't let him get me!</i>

05:22.220 --> 05:23.340
Touka!

05:24.800 --> 05:26.410
<i>He's coming after me!</i>

05:26.410 --> 05:28.640
<i>Damn it! Ain't there any way outta here?!</i>

05:31.640 --> 05:34.140
Wh-What the heck is this?

05:34.970 --> 05:36.950
<i>A paradise of thighs?!</i>

05:38.500 --> 05:41.660
Beyond the stone slab holding that mirror

05:41.660 --> 05:44.570
lies the ideal world of whoever looks into it.

05:45.010 --> 05:48.690
I don't know why it's here either...

05:48.690 --> 05:53.220
A reward for risking your life
for our lofty mission, perhaps.

05:53.670 --> 05:57.240
But once you go through, 
there's no guarantee you'll return.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.500
You won't be able to save Yuna.

05:59.500 --> 06:00.570
Huh?!

06:00.570 --> 06:04.670
I can't save Yuna anyway! I'm dead, man!

06:06.500 --> 06:07.880
That's right...

06:07.880 --> 06:09.970
I can't save Yuna now...

06:11.070 --> 06:13.720
Sorry, Yuna...

06:13.720 --> 06:15.350
You can still make it in time.

06:15.350 --> 06:17.500
You yet live, Touka!

06:18.440 --> 06:20.440
Humans are made up of three facets:

06:18.440 --> 06:28.610
<b>Life Force</b>

06:18.440 --> 06:28.610
<b>Body</b>

06:20.440 --> 06:22.210
the body, the soul that dwells in the head,

06:22.210 --> 06:26.360
and the life force that dwells in the heart.

06:26.000 --> 06:28.650
<b>Soul</b>

06:26.360 --> 06:28.650
You die if you lose any one of them.

06:28.650 --> 06:31.810
I've lost my life force,

06:31.810 --> 06:34.680
but your soul still exists,

06:34.680 --> 06:38.120
and both your body and life force lie 
inside the Coffin of the Living.

06:38.530 --> 06:42.330
In other words,
you just wandered here by mistake.

06:42.330 --> 06:44.740
What the hell are you talking about?

06:44.740 --> 06:46.260
This isn't the afterlife.

06:46.260 --> 06:47.800
It's the world of the Sacred Sword.

06:48.220 --> 06:51.850
It can call the souls
of dead legendary heroes here.

06:51.850 --> 06:55.970
You were wandering the boundary between life 
and death, so it brought you here as well.

06:55.970 --> 06:57.420
Wait, hang on a minute!

06:57.420 --> 06:59.080
I ain't a legendary—

06:59.080 --> 06:59.940
Touka.

06:59.940 --> 07:02.300
You've been chosen 
as the next legendary hero.

07:05.360 --> 07:07.100
That night in the capital,

07:07.100 --> 07:09.910
when your mana abruptly skyrocketed,

07:09.910 --> 07:13.450
it fooled the Sacred Sword into 
thinking you were the next hero.

07:13.950 --> 07:17.840
That's why you can use the Sacred Sword,
 even outside of my body.

07:20.160 --> 07:23.000
You mean... I really <i>am</i> a hero?

07:23.340 --> 07:29.230
I always thought my mana level 
had to be so low for a reason!

07:29.230 --> 07:32.180
I told you it was a misunderstanding, right?

07:32.180 --> 07:34.790
E-Even if what you're saying is true,

07:34.790 --> 07:37.390
if I can't get outta here, I can't...

07:37.950 --> 07:39.510
The exit is through there.

07:40.010 --> 07:45.610
But if you return to the real world,
you'll find yet harsher trials await you.

07:45.610 --> 07:49.790
If you wish to stay here instead,
I won't stop you.

07:50.970 --> 07:52.910
That's not even a question.

07:52.910 --> 07:55.610
Yuna and the others ain't here,

07:55.610 --> 08:00.040
which means my perfect 
thighs ain't here either.

08:00.760 --> 08:05.200
Besides, I promised Yuna 
I'd save her this time for sure.

08:13.460 --> 08:17.140
Shielding your whole body with 
a spell that absorbs magic, eh?

08:17.140 --> 08:19.210
<i>Physical attacks make it through,</i>

08:19.210 --> 08:22.520
<i>but it'll take time to shave down his mana.</i>

08:23.860 --> 08:25.220
We're out of time!

08:25.220 --> 08:27.980
The twenty-four hours will be up soon!

08:29.630 --> 08:31.360
Please, God...

08:31.760 --> 08:34.790
I'm happy to disappear.

08:34.790 --> 08:36.180
Just...

08:36.560 --> 08:38.740
Just make Touka wake up!

08:38.740 --> 08:39.830
Please!

08:41.110 --> 08:44.410
Will you let him stroke your thighs 
a hundred times while naked in stockings?

08:44.410 --> 08:45.660
I will!

08:45.660 --> 08:47.650
A hundred times! A thousand times!

08:47.650 --> 08:48.690
<i>What?</i>

08:48.690 --> 08:50.630
Hell yeah!

08:50.630 --> 08:53.220
That sounds like a promise to me, Yuna!

08:53.220 --> 08:54.380
Touka?!

08:54.380 --> 08:55.680
Sir Touka!

08:54.380 --> 08:55.680
Touka!

08:56.360 --> 08:58.640
Touka Scott!

09:00.370 --> 09:04.600
Even though you're awake now,
don't you think it's a little late to win?!

09:04.600 --> 09:06.230
Oh, I'll win!

09:06.230 --> 09:09.790
Thigh-stroking paradise awaits me
 when the battle's over!

09:09.790 --> 09:11.470
I'm winning for sure!

09:11.470 --> 09:12.580
Hang on a minute!

09:12.580 --> 09:14.160
That wasn't a real promise!

09:14.160 --> 09:14.780
Anri!

09:14.780 --> 09:18.200
Release my body from 
the Coffin of the Living!

09:20.160 --> 09:21.850
I'm gonna show you...

09:21.850 --> 09:25.290
another power of the Sacred Sword
that the hero taught me!

09:26.930 --> 09:29.330
Another power of the Sacred Sword?

09:29.330 --> 09:30.920
Can I borrow that, Kyle?

09:32.380 --> 09:34.590
When did he—

09:35.580 --> 09:37.550
Who the hell are you?!

09:38.060 --> 09:39.220
I am...

09:39.220 --> 09:41.260
Sion Breydan!

09:41.260 --> 09:44.060
<b>3 minutes until Yuna and the others become devils</b>

09:48.030 --> 09:50.730
All right, I believe I can fight in this body.

09:50.730 --> 09:52.090
What's going on here?

09:52.090 --> 09:54.030
How is Touka so cool now?!

09:54.030 --> 09:56.720
Sion's soul was still in the Sacred Sword.

09:56.720 --> 09:58.910
I sent it to possess my body.

09:58.910 --> 10:01.370
And what's this "Touka is cool <i>now</i>" garbage?!

10:01.370 --> 10:03.590
You make it sound like I wasn't cool before!

10:03.590 --> 10:05.560
I mean, I think that about sums it up.

10:05.560 --> 10:06.280
What?!

10:06.970 --> 10:09.830
The hero...? Is that really you?

10:10.710 --> 10:11.940
I feel it!

10:11.940 --> 10:15.200
The comforting sensation
of that crystal-clear mana!

10:15.200 --> 10:16.800
It's you, Sion!

10:17.130 --> 10:20.340
Kyle, I'm quite cross with you, you know.

10:20.340 --> 10:23.540
Ah, so you know the whole story?

10:23.540 --> 10:27.440
It was all just my love for you
running out of control.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.690
Forgive me.

10:30.400 --> 10:34.320
You sent the soul of the dead hero,
 Sion, to possess you?

10:34.660 --> 10:38.350
Since when can the Sacred Sword 
perform necromancy?!

10:38.350 --> 10:40.280
I've never heard of such a power!

10:40.280 --> 10:41.740
However...

10:41.740 --> 10:45.580
Fighting the legendary hero is 
the most fun thing I can imagine!

10:49.230 --> 10:50.870
<i>I-It can't be!</i>

10:51.390 --> 10:52.830
<i>The way you're moving...</i>

10:52.830 --> 10:55.300
<i>You're in Touka Scott's body!</i>

10:55.630 --> 10:58.010
<i>How can you move like that?!</i>

10:58.010 --> 11:00.250
<i>This is the true hero, Sion...</i>

11:00.250 --> 11:02.470
<i>The champion who saved the world!</i>

11:03.390 --> 11:04.710
Touka!

11:06.430 --> 11:09.060
You're the only one 
who can use the Sacred Sword.

11:09.060 --> 11:11.690
I can only offer support.

11:11.690 --> 11:15.320
<b>Magic Crystal</b>

11:12.030 --> 11:15.320
First, I'll destroy Vertex's magic crystal.

11:15.700 --> 11:17.420
With that gone,

11:17.420 --> 11:22.070
Vertex won't be able to use its spell, 
or any it's absorbed, for a while.

11:22.070 --> 11:25.800
Though obviously, it will 
restore itself quite quickly...

11:25.800 --> 11:29.790
So I've gotta finish the job 
before it regenerates?

11:29.790 --> 11:32.410
But at your current mana level,

11:32.410 --> 11:34.650
you won't be able to 
penetrate Vertex's head.

11:34.650 --> 11:35.590
Are you kidding me?!

11:35.590 --> 11:37.500
We're out of soma drops, man!

11:37.500 --> 11:41.720
You can shorten the blade of 
the Sacred Sword to concentrate your mana.

11:41.720 --> 11:44.510
That should increase its penetrative power.

11:44.510 --> 11:46.010
Form change...

11:46.010 --> 11:46.850
Dagger!

11:48.070 --> 11:49.270
I'm not finished yet!

11:55.740 --> 11:59.180
My blood magic isn't tied to Vertex!

11:59.180 --> 12:01.600
I'll take this chance to regenerate myself!

12:02.740 --> 12:06.800
With your shields gone, I can shred you
with my magic as much as I need to.

12:07.190 --> 12:09.200
I've given you the time you need...

12:09.200 --> 12:10.370
Touka!

12:10.950 --> 12:13.920
<b>60 seconds until Yuna and the others become devils</b>

12:14.880 --> 12:16.830
<i>Ein Grendel!</i>

12:21.460 --> 12:22.880
Not so fast!

12:23.770 --> 12:26.600
Sorry, but my student's gonna win this.

12:26.600 --> 12:29.050
I taught him how to use one of these too.

12:29.500 --> 12:32.050
He's been so preoccupied 
with the Sacred Sword

12:32.050 --> 12:34.520
that he hasn't had his wits about him,

12:35.190 --> 12:38.360
but now that he's holding
a weapon he's familiar with,

12:38.360 --> 12:42.020
he can focus his full attention on dodging.

12:43.650 --> 12:45.990
Touka Scott!

12:45.990 --> 12:48.320
Is this how you want to do this?!

12:48.320 --> 12:51.540
Relying on others to nail me to the wall?

12:51.540 --> 12:54.530
Is that really enough to satisfy you?!

12:54.530 --> 12:59.040
Let's enjoy our battle a little bit more!

12:59.540 --> 13:00.890
Sorry, man!

13:00.890 --> 13:03.970
I never gave a damn about our battle!

13:03.970 --> 13:06.930
Saving Yuna is all I ever wanted to do!

13:10.390 --> 13:13.350
<b>1 second until Yuna and the others become devils</b>

13:44.180 --> 13:46.820
That was a close one.

13:46.820 --> 13:51.110
Tossing my Coffin of the Living 
into the forest was a smart move.

13:51.110 --> 13:52.350
Damn...

13:52.350 --> 13:54.950
Why can't I move?

13:54.950 --> 13:57.940
Have I expended my soul?

13:57.940 --> 14:01.090
No... it's just normal exhaustion.

14:01.090 --> 14:03.650
That's right. It's not over yet...

14:03.650 --> 14:06.820
Once I'm recovered,
it'll be time for a grudge match!

14:10.190 --> 14:12.310
What are you doing here?

14:12.310 --> 14:14.080
Who ordered you...

14:17.970 --> 14:20.610
You killed Queen Adele...

14:20.610 --> 14:22.500
Now you'll pay!

14:22.930 --> 14:25.410
Damn it! Why can't I move?!

14:25.410 --> 14:26.590
Damn it!

14:26.590 --> 14:28.470
This is the stupidest way to die!

14:33.720 --> 14:36.650
Incredible! The Infernal General is dead!

14:36.650 --> 14:38.380
The legendary hero slew it!

14:38.380 --> 14:39.920
The hero! The hero!

14:39.920 --> 14:41.020
Touka!

14:45.010 --> 14:46.890
You're safe?

14:46.890 --> 14:47.910
Yes...

14:48.570 --> 14:52.370
I can see Dame Yuna too.

14:53.670 --> 14:55.250
Touka!

14:55.910 --> 14:58.310
How could you be so reckless?

14:58.310 --> 15:01.200
I thought you were really gonna die!

15:03.150 --> 15:05.840
Why the heck were you worried about me?

15:06.380 --> 15:09.720
I saved you this time, just like I promised.

15:09.720 --> 15:13.300
So keep your part of the bargain and
let me stroke your thighs a hundred times!

15:13.300 --> 15:15.900
What? I don't remember promising you that...

15:15.900 --> 15:18.000
I've been unconscious this whole time.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.220
But when you were just a soul...

15:20.220 --> 15:22.280
You must have been hallucinating!

15:22.280 --> 15:25.390
Right, Anri? I wasn't there, was I?

15:25.390 --> 15:27.730
Nope! I never saw you!

15:27.730 --> 15:30.030
Damn you, Anri! Don't toy with me!

15:31.370 --> 15:33.810
<i>The long day finally came to an end.</i>

15:33.810 --> 15:37.300
<i>We didn't see Master 
or Anri's brother after that.</i>

15:37.300 --> 15:38.620
<i>Then, we...</i>

15:38.940 --> 15:42.330
We're holding this party
in the legendary hero's honor!

15:42.330 --> 15:44.040
I appreciate it,

15:44.040 --> 15:47.210
but I think I'd be more 
comfortable hanging out in my room...

15:47.210 --> 15:48.970
I know what you mean.

15:48.970 --> 15:51.280
Beautiful girls with luscious thighs, right?

15:52.020 --> 15:55.830
The young women of my town have been
racing to me to offer themselves...

15:55.830 --> 15:58.600
as overnight companions 
to the legendary hero.

15:58.600 --> 16:00.310
<i>Overnight companions?!</i>

16:00.310 --> 16:02.210
You freaking rock, man!

16:02.210 --> 16:04.020
You're the mayor of my heart!

16:04.770 --> 16:06.980
Oh, Your Highness!

16:06.980 --> 16:10.340
It was my swift work that
ensured the safety of the town

16:10.340 --> 16:13.050
and the defeat of that Infernal General.

16:13.050 --> 16:15.200
Y-Yes... it was.

16:15.200 --> 16:18.430
As a reward, I'd like the promised 
naked-in-stockings...

16:18.950 --> 16:21.670
I'm afraid Touka offered that 
without my consent.

16:21.670 --> 16:23.830
I never intended to honor that promise.

16:23.830 --> 16:25.920
Isaac! Please, save me!

16:25.920 --> 16:27.460
Naked in stockings!

16:27.460 --> 16:28.800
You traitor!

16:28.800 --> 16:31.220
Calm down a little, would you?

16:31.220 --> 16:33.340
Er... Touka, was it?

16:33.340 --> 16:36.300
I came to thank you for saving me.

16:36.300 --> 16:39.980
<i>That's right. Touka was in my body then...</i>

16:39.980 --> 16:43.770
I can explain the whole story later,
 but the real Touka is...

16:43.770 --> 16:46.560
Mr. Hero! Come play with me soon!

16:46.560 --> 16:49.480
No way! He's gonna play with me!

16:51.020 --> 16:52.160
No need to fight, ladies!

16:52.160 --> 16:55.450
I can get to all of your thighs in one night!

16:56.280 --> 16:57.590
Y-Yuna?

16:57.590 --> 16:58.780
What's going on?

16:59.830 --> 17:02.700
What the hell? Things were 
looking good for me there!

17:04.170 --> 17:05.170
<i>What the...</i>

17:05.170 --> 17:08.220
<i>Why'd I just drag Touka in here?</i>

17:08.220 --> 17:12.220
<i>I saw him surrounded by girls, 
and my heart went crazy...</i>

17:12.220 --> 17:13.130
<i>What the heck?!</i>

17:13.890 --> 17:18.050
Is it time for the hundred strokes of your 
naked-in-stockings thighs you promised me?!

17:18.050 --> 17:19.730
You're not stroking anything!

17:19.730 --> 17:23.250
That deal was off the minute 
you summoned Mr. Hero!

17:23.250 --> 17:24.930
Huh? How come?!

17:24.930 --> 17:27.900
It's true that the hero helped me out, but...

17:29.310 --> 17:30.860
Well, fine.

17:30.860 --> 17:34.820
Real talk, having you safe 
is reward enough for me.

17:35.740 --> 17:38.960
And you got to be rescued
by your beloved "Mr. Hero" again,

17:38.960 --> 17:41.700
so I guess it's the perfect 
ending for both of us.

17:42.160 --> 17:44.660
<i>No. That's not it...</i>

17:44.660 --> 17:48.370
Look, once I buff up my mana back up,
I can summon him again,

17:48.370 --> 17:51.000
so you can tell him how you feel then.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.960
Stop running off at the mouth and listen!

17:52.960 --> 17:56.490
I know you're the one who saved me this time!

17:56.490 --> 17:59.930
And I'm really happy that 
you're the one that did!

17:59.930 --> 18:01.460
<i>Yuna...</i>

18:02.060 --> 18:05.960
If you're so happy,
why renege on your promise?

18:05.960 --> 18:07.940
Darn it! Why are you like this?!

18:09.440 --> 18:10.880
F-Fine.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.900
I just have to keep my word, right?

18:12.900 --> 18:15.990
I'll make good on my promise.

18:18.030 --> 18:19.300
<i>Hey, hey, hey!</i>

18:19.300 --> 18:21.180
<i>Is this really happening right now?!</i>

18:21.180 --> 18:23.450
<i>I'm nervous as hell all of a sudden...</i>

18:23.450 --> 18:27.370
<i>For real, are we finally
gonna go all the way?!</i>

18:27.930 --> 18:29.920
Okay... I'm ready.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.820
What's with the swimsuit?

18:35.820 --> 18:37.260
I'm embarrassed, okay?!

18:38.530 --> 18:42.350
I-If you don't like it,
take it off yourself.

18:43.180 --> 18:44.340
<i>Take it off?!</i>

18:44.340 --> 18:46.140
<i>She's gonna let me do that, too?!</i>

18:46.140 --> 18:47.940
Just do it already.

18:47.940 --> 18:49.600
I'm pretty embarrassed.

18:49.600 --> 18:51.220
R-Right...

18:51.740 --> 18:53.570
<i>No, hang on a minute.</i>

18:53.890 --> 18:57.090
That hero guy said he was watching me.

18:57.090 --> 18:58.650
He could be right now.

18:59.820 --> 19:01.610
Better toss the Sacred Sword.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.520
<i>He was watching?!</i>

19:03.520 --> 19:06.580
<i>Mr. Hero... saw me like this?!</i>

19:06.580 --> 19:09.060
No! Mr. Hero, you perv!

19:09.060 --> 19:09.790
Yuna!

19:10.350 --> 19:12.000
I'm... a perv?

19:12.000 --> 19:14.210
I did accidentally catch a glimpse, but...

19:15.320 --> 19:16.670
That was close!

19:16.670 --> 19:20.070
I must've been crazy
to let him do that to me.

19:20.070 --> 19:22.070
Seriously crazy...

19:22.070 --> 19:24.650
Whenever I'm around Touka, 
I get all flustered.

19:24.650 --> 19:27.290
My heart starts to ache, 
and my face feels hot...

19:27.290 --> 19:28.140
Wait.

19:28.140 --> 19:29.100
Can it be...

19:29.100 --> 19:31.030
It's surely love.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.560
Y-Your Highness?!

19:32.930 --> 19:35.910
You've fallen in love with Touka.

19:35.910 --> 19:37.890
In love? No way!

19:37.890 --> 19:42.030
That trashy, pervy jerk 
only likes me for my thighs.

19:42.030 --> 19:44.740
Yet in spite of that, he saved you.

19:45.190 --> 19:46.790
I feel the same way.

19:46.790 --> 19:49.950
When I sit down and think, 
I know he's utterly unacceptable.

19:49.950 --> 19:52.990
But in the moment he was saving me,

19:52.990 --> 19:55.040
Touka was the legendary hero,
without question.

19:58.180 --> 20:00.550
<i>I'm the one who reached out to him,</i>

20:00.550 --> 20:03.510
<i>and I never felt like he was
more than a little brother...</i>

20:03.510 --> 20:06.470
<i>that I had to keep dragging him along...</i>

20:09.050 --> 20:11.390
What is it, Your Highness?

20:11.970 --> 20:14.850
I'd like it if you'd call me Marguerite.

20:15.290 --> 20:18.650
Because we're going to be rivals 
from this moment forward,

20:18.650 --> 20:23.320
I'd like to interact as equals, 
without status being a factor.

20:23.320 --> 20:24.990
And, of course...

20:25.410 --> 20:30.190
because we'll continue to be
 companions in our journey.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.950
I did sorta feel like I couldn't
get close to you before.

20:34.950 --> 20:35.880
So...

20:37.510 --> 20:40.520
Let's start things fresh, Marguerite!

20:41.510 --> 20:43.460
No fair!

20:43.460 --> 20:45.700
I also want Dame Marguerite...

20:46.140 --> 20:47.830
No, I can't call you that!

20:47.830 --> 20:50.430
I must address you as a princess!

20:50.730 --> 20:54.520
All else aside, I need to ask if anything 
transpired between you and Touka.

20:54.520 --> 20:56.430
As your rival, I must know!

20:56.430 --> 20:58.000
I'm not telling you that!

20:58.000 --> 20:59.330
That stuff's private!

20:59.330 --> 21:01.220
Aha, I know this!

21:01.220 --> 21:02.690
A hundred thigh strokes, right?

21:02.690 --> 21:04.360
Hey, Anri!

21:05.200 --> 21:11.450
<i>Right before Sion the hero disappeared, 
he told the four of us where to go next.</i>

21:11.830 --> 21:13.130
Sheesh.

21:13.130 --> 21:14.700
We made it through one crisis,

21:14.700 --> 21:18.170
but I guess this stupid journey to 
the Gates of Hell ain't over yet.

21:18.600 --> 21:21.820
No, your destination lies elsewhere.

21:21.820 --> 21:22.630
Huh?

21:23.030 --> 21:27.450
The northern continent, home to the
Gates of Hell, is a nest of powerful devils.

21:27.450 --> 21:31.850
It would be suicidal for you
to head there as you are now.

21:31.850 --> 21:36.180
Touka, you first need to focus on 
increasing your mana level.

21:36.180 --> 21:39.160
Once you do, I'll be able
to fight with you again.

21:39.660 --> 21:41.690
C'mon, I can just boost it with soma—

21:41.690 --> 21:45.930
You should be well aware by now that 
soma drops are too dangerous.

21:46.400 --> 21:50.660
But how's a guy supposed to up his mana level?

21:51.010 --> 21:54.870
I have a companion who knows 
a great deal about mana.

21:55.190 --> 21:59.830
Kyle, Dorothy. Will you 
guide Touka in my place?

21:59.830 --> 22:03.300
I'm incapable of saying no 
to you, Sion. However...

22:03.300 --> 22:05.800
is the companion you're talking about...

22:06.110 --> 22:08.760
Yes. Find the sage.

22:09.490 --> 22:10.970
The sage?

22:13.350 --> 22:16.480
Honey Honey Honey Honey

22:13.720 --> 22:15.790
Okay, you four.

22:15.790 --> 22:18.060
Ready to head out?

22:16.480 --> 22:20.850
Hi, Honey Honey Trap Trap

22:19.380 --> 22:20.380
Yep!

22:22.000 --> 22:27.140
Hey, I've got a melty marshmallow secret

22:28.470 --> 22:32.370
It's just bursting with sugar, you know...

22:32.370 --> 22:37.660
Hey, I know you want a taste... don't you?

22:38.750 --> 22:42.690
Don't bother to hide it, it's clear as day...

22:42.690 --> 22:45.460
Come a little closer, now

22:45.460 --> 22:49.500
A fleeting glimpse of lusty pink

22:49.500 --> 22:52.640
A seductive voice with a hint of danger

22:52.640 --> 22:58.200
See? I've already got you under my spell...

23:01.270 --> 23:04.720
It's a true-true-true hazard to pursue

23:04.720 --> 23:08.500
This sweetest trap of romance

23:08.500 --> 23:11.310
So cu-cu-cu-cute how you'll fall in love...

23:11.310 --> 23:14.240
In this literal pit I dug!

23:15.120 --> 23:18.350
You can't shoo-shoo-shoo me 
away when I pursue

23:18.350 --> 23:22.210
Such intense romance needs a strategy

23:22.210 --> 23:26.380
I'll kee-kee-kee-keep on 
setting bait every day...

23:27.130 --> 23:28.920
In my honey trap

23:28.920 --> 23:31.890
Honey Honey Honey Honey

23:31.890 --> 23:36.220
Hi, Honey Honey Trap Trap
